# Commit Messages

Write short, one-line commit messages. No bullet lists, no body text.

Format: `<type>: <what was done>`

Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `chore`, `docs`, `style`, `test`

**Examples:**
- `feat: add theme build script`
- `fix: resolve mcp server utils export`
- `refactor: simplify component docs generation`
- `chore: update dependencies`

**Rules:**
- Max ~72 characters
- No period at end
- No bullet points or multi-line body
- Lowercase after the colon
